{"seq":1,"slug":"method-ordering-default","title":"支付方式排序与默认推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/checkout-payment-method-orchestration/method-presentation/method-ordering-default","wordCount":2600,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"支付方式排序与默认推荐\">支付方式排序与默认推荐</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可用性判定给出一个<strong>无序的</strong>集合（见 <a href=\"../payment-method-availability/method-eligibility-rules\">按市场/币种/订单/客户的可用规则</a>），排序层的职责是把它变成一个<strong>有顺序、有默认项、有分组</strong>的呈现。顺序不是审美问题：结账页上排第一的方式拿到的点击占比通常远高于其后的方式，默认项（预选中或高亮的那一个）更是直接决定相当一部分订单走哪条清算路径。顺序错了，损失的是转化率、手续费和后续的退款与拒付结构。</p>\n<p>排序同时要满足三类性质不同的目标，它们会互相冲突：<strong>买家目标</strong>（用我最方便的方式，以最少步骤完成）、<strong>商户目标</strong>（用成本最低、成功率最高、拒付风险最低的方式）、<strong>合规目标</strong>（某些市场的本地方式需要被「突出」呈现，某些方式的营销文案受约束）。排序模型的价值就在于把这个冲突<strong>显式化并参数化</strong>，而不是让产品经理在需求文档里拍一个顺序。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[候选方式集合] --&gt; B[候选来源标注&lt;br/&gt;收藏/上次使用/推荐/其他]&#10;    B --&gt; C{存在已保存令牌?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[令牌组置顶&lt;br/&gt;默认项=上次成功使用的令牌]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E{买家偏好信号可用?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[按偏好打分]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[按市场基准顺序]&#10;    F --&gt; H[叠加商户权重&lt;br/&gt;成本/成功率/风险]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[应用合规突出规则&lt;br/&gt;本地方式前置]&#10;    I --&gt; J[截断与分组&lt;br/&gt;主列表+更多]&#10;    J --&gt; K[输出排序与默认项&lt;br/&gt;写决策快照]\">flowchart TD\n    A[候选方式集合] --&gt; B[候选来源标注&lt;br/&gt;收藏/上次使用/推荐/其他]\n    B --&gt; C{存在已保存令牌?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[令牌组置顶&lt;br/&gt;默认项=上次成功使用的令牌]\n    C --&gt;|否| E{买家偏好信号可用?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[按偏好打分]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[按市场基准顺序]\n    F --&gt; H[叠加商户权重&lt;br/&gt;成本/成功率/风险]\n    G --&gt; H\n    D --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[应用合规突出规则&lt;br/&gt;本地方式前置]\n    I --&gt; J[截断与分组&lt;br/&gt;主列表+更多]\n    J --&gt; K[输出排序与默认项&lt;br/&gt;写决策快照]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>典型诉求</th>\n<th>排序中的表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>买家便利</td>\n<td>少填、少跳转、用熟悉的</td>\n<td>收藏与上次使用优先、快捷支付优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商户成本</td>\n<td>低费率、低拒付、快结算</td>\n<td>方式权重（收益分）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商户成功率</td>\n<td>授权通过率高</td>\n<td>结合健康度的成功率先验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规</td>\n<td>本地方式需显著呈现</td>\n<td>合规突出规则，优先级最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>顺序不能频繁跳变</td>\n<td>分数平滑 + 变更节流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"排序信号与打分模型\">排序信号与打分模型</h2><h3 id=\"可分层的信号\">可分层的信号</h3><p>把信号按<strong>稳定性和因果距离</strong>分层，能让模型既好解释又好调参。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层是个体强信号</strong>：买家的已保存令牌、上次成功使用的令牌、收藏的方式。这一层的权重应当高到「几乎直接决定默认项」，因为它是唯一带明确行为证据的信号；这里必须区分「上次成功」与「上次尝试」，把一个上次失败的方式默认选中会直接复现失败。<strong>第二层是市场基准</strong>：该市场买家群体的方式偏好分布，来自你自己历史订单在该市场的成功支付方式构成，且必须按市场（甚至市场 × 币种 × 设备形态）分别统计，全球均值在任何一个具体市场都是错的。<strong>第三层是商户权重</strong>：费率、结算周期、拒付率、争议成本，必须以<strong>显式配置</strong>的形式存在（谁调了、调了多少、为什么），不能藏在算法里。<strong>第四层是合规突出规则</strong>：某些市场要求本地方式以不低于某个显著度的方式呈现，这是<strong>硬约束</strong>，实现上是「把它提到前 N 位」或「固定位置」，优先级高于任何打分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"打分的正确形态\">打分的正确形态</h3><p>打分的常见错误是把不同量纲的信号直接相加。正确做法是先把每个信号归一化到可比较的尺度，再加权。一个可落地的形态是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(m) = \\sum_{k} w_k \\cdot \\hat{f}_k(m) + \\sum_{c} \\beta_c \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[c(m)] + p_{compliance}(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ian</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{f}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化后的连续特征（偏好分、成本分、成功率先验），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}[c(m)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span> 是类别型信号的指示函数（是否已保存令牌、是否快捷支付、是否上次成功），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其固定加成；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{compliance}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ian</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是合规位置约束产生的位移量。把连续特征与类别特征分开表达，是因为它们的量纲与调参直觉完全不同：前者靠数据拟合，后者靠产品与合规拍定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;ranking_profile&quot;: &quot;market_de_default&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2026-09-14.3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;weights&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;buyer_preference&quot;: 0.45,&#10;    &quot;merchant_cost&quot;: 0.2,&#10;    &quot;auth_success_prior&quot;: 0.25,&#10;    &quot;settlement_speed&quot;: 0.1&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;boosts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;saved_token&quot;: 0.55,&#10;    &quot;last_successful_method&quot;: 0.35,&#10;    &quot;express_quickpay&quot;: 0.25,&#10;    &quot;compliance_featured&quot;: 0.9&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;compliance_position&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;method&quot;: &quot;sepa_direct_debit&qu